  "name": "Rosedalean SMP season 2",
  "summary": "[18+] Rosedalean SMP season 2 - Hop on and make some friends !",
  "description": "# Rosedalean SMP - Season 2\n\n### This is an 18+ server!\nPlease only apply if you're **18 years of age or older.**\n\nWelcome to the **Rosedalean SMP!** We're currently in Season 2, which means a fresh start and a whole new chance for you to get involved!\n\n## Mods & Gameplay\n\nWe've specially curated a wide range of standout mods with something for all types of players, including:\n\n- A variety of furniture and decoration mods\n- **Create**, along with plenty of Create addons\n- **Biomes O' Plenty** for loads of extra biomes\n- **Proximity Voice Chat**\n- **Tectonic** for a more interesting and exciting world\n- And so, so, so much more!\n\nWhether you enjoy building, exploring, messing around with Create, or just finding somewhere nice to settle down, there's plenty to do.\n\n## Lore & Roleplay\n\nIf lore is your style, we also have a dedicated community to act and play with!\n\nWhether you want to create your own character and roleplay with others, get involved with the server's stories, or simply settle down with a cool base while hanging out with friends, we could be the server for you.\n\nThere's also **no requirement to participate in lore** if that's not your thing.\n\n## Community\n\nWe strive to be a **community-based server** and have big plans for guilds and community events that bring people together.\n\nThis includes in-game events, weekly Discord game nights, and collaborative story-building for anyone interested in the lore side of the server.\n\n## Interested?\n\nJoin our Discord to apply, get approved, and be whitelisted:\n\n**https://discord.gg/ue2AJBe2V5**",
